# r04 S5: the stock Fedora kernel the ordinary-VM guest (stock-unpinned, lab-ready-r04) runs. Same NVR as
# build-rt-kernel.sh's default KERNEL_NVR (kernel-7.2.11-200.fc44), so stock and RT runs differ only in
# the preemption model. Installed in the guest only (scripts/lab/README.md), checked by check-prereqs.sh --vm.
LAB_STOCK_KERNEL="7.2.11-200.fc44"
